{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "6c9cb2f3f536939d6a39b1e0d663355842c641fbc846afdabfdbb98631c3ea32", "ja": "可能性は無限大", "zh": "可能性无限大", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5da3b0011c58393918f2f9eecfa34fb2764ef7a51c75776a37aa9ce79c7dc3ca", "ja": "エレナと美也の希望で、打ち上げは公園で\nピクニックをすることに。お世話になった\n人達を大勢呼んで、みんなで楽しむという。\n思わぬ形で広がっていく絆に、\n無限大の可能性を覚えるプロデューサー。", "zh": "在艾琳娜与美也的要求之下，\n庆功宴决定办在公园，以野餐的形式\n邀请帮过自己的人们一起来众乐乐。\n看到意外拓展开来的友谊，\n制作人知道了什么是无限大的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a088fb9f84e688c319037004338686bdaf4f300a5583fcf5d63d44c031d1e8e", "ja": "（エレナと美也のユニット、Cleaskyのライブが\n無事終わった。今日は、打ち上げだが……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜跟美也的团体『Cleasky』的演唱会\n顺利结束了。今天是庆功的日子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "f65589d6e6c46e88814a54aa21d3150b0aed72e10c16af8b33f911e9a600b782", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}、やっと来たヨ～。\nこっちこっち！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，你终于来了～\n这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "ef7f7ffd7377ecaa3a187d13210c4ef5df44e23331496679e961a0ed9fce8089", "ja": "{$P$}さん、こちらですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，在这里喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "433c6d6595b60db7704dec514738ae52e6a1eedbb5c967bb0e783424c9b780cb", "ja": "ど、どっちに行けばいいんだ……ん？\nふたりとも、ちょっと待ってくれ。", "zh": "到、到底要我去哪啊……嗯？\n你们两个，先等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b2778a5443be0722009de854aba20981d14bd868f7c6ac8ea3d14eea0cb699ec", "ja": "ピクニック広場に行くには、このまま\nまっすぐ突っ切ったほうが早いみたいだぞ。", "zh": "要去野餐广场的话，\n直接穿越这里好像比较快喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "76cad025f0ca4018e97d24ad52299cb0907ac30fc9d696320348b91c29b73c6c", "ja": "なんと～、そうでしたか～。\nでは、まっすぐ歩いて行きますよ～。", "zh": "什么～是这样啊～\n那我们就直直前进吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "ded9073094d6d76ac6fae682f0cc302607a7fde4952b6c0df2870ea3247dab5a", "ja": "ハーイ♪\nピクニック、ピクニック、楽しいナ♪", "zh": "好──♪\n野餐，野餐，好开心喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1007_null", "source_sha256": "f35d0918940694c0e68b1578c4db56197fffe519e02ea90201b601728ec12ba0", "ja": "グゥー……。", "zh": "咕～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "612aad490bf2ffa1e11488359ef95abda8964b17fc9c6836352c99b865170672", "ja": "……あれ？　今の音って……。", "zh": "……咦？刚刚的声音是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "66df8d92481c010f45b94fac2a02d4dc3c656cfbe999415a55af061b8022841b", "ja": "す、すまない。俺のお腹の音だ。", "zh": "不、不好意思，是我的肚子在叫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "ac575c2cf1f323ddffd0607f39fb5e94a57c31577aacf9396533241661506ce1", "ja": "{$P$}、お腹が空いてるノ？", "zh": "{$P$}，你肚子饿了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b80d51b253fc172112c0c3c9b071fef6e4d1fb1beffdef294fe03d262c88ec2b", "ja": "今朝寝坊して、朝食を食べそこねたから……\nそのせいかな。", "zh": "我今天早上睡过头，没吃到早餐……\n原因可能出在这。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "36d7896b42cebaba8a795aa2b818c701cc21b0bdee6d063666c164e5cd728ce9", "ja": "なんと～、{$P$}さんは腹ペコ\nでしたか～。では、着いたらお昼にしましょうね～。", "zh": "什么～{$P$}先生肚子空空呀～\n那我们到了以后就吃午餐吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "307e121d6593df63dea3d0ca7327557ad63d9792b3e7732b67eb8288c664764a", "ja": "おまたせしました～。\n美也特製、サンドイッチランチですよ～。じゃ～ん。", "zh": "久等了～\n这是美也特制的三明治午餐喔～锵锵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "292f96f358600c8453166860ba9483ad9c4c3c20fb581718a34f418e7d015ac9", "ja": "おお……！", "zh": "喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "d9fa581bfa1ba80100d52350eed9b63db34c24f38fc314f4998492bfd237f29c", "ja": "ミヤのサンドイッチ、将棋の駒の形してる！？\nすごくかわいいヨー！", "zh": "美也的三明治是将棋的形状耶！？\n好可爱喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "69b1eed0d9f5f32920d03e6eca0b0a130eb9f05e3939cb712fbb33b1bd44b6af", "ja": "むふふ、気づいてもらえましたか～。将棋を通して、\nエレナさんと仲良くなれましたからね～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，你发现了呀～因为将棋，\n让我跟艾琳娜变得更要好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee9e5b95a13a67b1e79aa4e6fd58dcdb7f342318b735fc5b5441b0dad8d27625", "ja": "本当は、サッカーボールも作ろうと思ったのですが、\n難しくて断念してしまいました～。", "zh": "其实我原本还想做足球造型的，\n但难度太高，只好放弃了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "53df083fc7a6e0f370dc10c4210f251226cacc1eb64c82a897f1974590df3c77", "ja": "うん、サッカーボールは流石に難しそうだな……。", "zh": "嗯，足球我想是没有办法吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "338573cf8ab866e9e3c970fbf94ea0a05730b3e02f1a455f82e14963cf0cc6c2", "ja": "こちらのウィンナーは、\n{$P$}さんをイメージしました～。", "zh": "这边的小香肠是参考\n{$P$}先生做出来的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7edb68cfa1e04fc5a98fc0aa7fe24891977289ea1cd135224fafc40e07b07102", "ja": "普通のタコさんウィンナーにしか見えないんだけど、\n美也には俺がどう見えているんだ……？", "zh": "看上去就只是普通的章鱼小香肠而已，\n我在美也眼里到底是长什么样子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c653017e875ca221ceeb29b0c073f0f01d8ec1fca2c15134576010f22c8f02f", "ja": "ワタシも、ママンと一緒に作ってきたヨ！\nエレナ特製ブラジル料理、召し上がれ♪", "zh": "我也跟妈妈一起做了菜喔！\n艾琳娜特制的巴西料理，两位请用♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "879604b2b320ecf07c59bc22fb989b56d2b243694c2f9609816a2d1d1e8241ce", "ja": "おお、エレナのお弁当も美味しそうだな……！\nそれじゃ、さっそくいただくよ。", "zh": "哦喔，艾琳娜的便当好像也很好吃……！\n那我就开动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "aacf624a601a99ad3c5c7b7cf1e050c85b6c572f89fd380e97339a2a9eace1c8", "ja": "いただきます～。", "zh": "我开动了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "2967de69451077f4eee6aa1a5c52fee2d5b510388f5a92c929e70cd21616cbb4", "ja": "いただきま～す！", "zh": "我开动了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "67d44e212649d82c9ddcb126f49e4ba16275bd120e3197a68419973d2bace166", "ja": "……うん、美也のサンドイッチもエレナの豆の煮込みも\n美味しい。ふたりとも、料理が上手なんだな。", "zh": "……美也的三明治跟艾琳娜的炖豆都很好吃。\n你们俩都厨艺了得呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "264e0148142bdbc93278bd3ca7292392a9e1ed066199a338790815b36d3a22a2", "ja": "むふふ、ありがとうございます～。エレナさん、\nこのコロッケ、とっても美味しいですね～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，谢谢夸奖～艾琳娜，\n这个可乐饼真好吃～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "cd2716fb6be26f02b9e3954eff88d2be99d8e390be2548fcdfc50ec0e819e5a0", "ja": "コシーニャっていうんだヨ！\nミヤにも今度、作り方を教えてあげるネ♪", "zh": "那个叫做巴西炸鸡肉包喔！\n我下次跟美也说说作法♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "f04eeeafade4517bea12238acbbfd5304de835b3202bfdaf0701afe038b815e0", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。では私は、\nサンドイッチの作り方を教えてあげますね～。", "zh": "谢谢～\n那我就教你怎么做三明治吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "77d194c88e53d4c2250b7b6a16a34e6f476c654092316ce62bd116eab52c7752", "ja": "ライブ前、エレナさんと話してたんですよ～。\n打ち上げは、ピクニックがいいな～って。", "zh": "上台表演前，我跟艾琳娜就在讲了～\n庆功宴想要到外头野餐～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "8edb8796dad462774e441179cdac27fb3029acad31821f9a95c4336c0556d0d2", "ja": "なので、お天気がよくて、よかったです～♪", "zh": "所以看到天气这么棒，真是太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "5f77de7819daf990b1d736cde2878b5e70b8ab64be8e72ac5992b099f98df006", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}！\n終わりの後に、さっそくいいコトがあったネ？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}！\n结束之后马上就有好事发生了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "a89d9dd9f691a6576ee06e0115ce311c95bac28d2bbc39d7019c4376f7ff1f03", "ja": "だってワタシ達のライブが無事に終わったから、\nピクニックで、美味しいモノが食べられたんだよネ♪", "zh": "因为我们的演唱会顺利结束，\n所以才能来野餐，吃到好吃的料理对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "99f6a07c5e7ec0c5ac912e0a991782458efe7b663a88dd6fb4f4a4689eb2ed00", "ja": "そうですね～。楽しいライブの後は、\nいつもちょっぴり寂しい気持ちになりますけど……。", "zh": "说得没错～每次欢乐的演唱会一结束，\n总是会给人一种寂寥的感受，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "66f1c44dd537ac8a4ec40a877fd0f0941fba09878aa0dc246693756894f866be", "ja": "その後は、こんなに楽しいことがあるんですね～。\n終わりは始まりの第一歩、ですな～。", "zh": "没想到后面还有这么开心的事在等着我们～\n结束就是开始的第一步，这话说得对极了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "59b13161e29d998b0d2e41ab51a8df565e07b0ed13aba42681a3fdb525df76a7", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！\nこれも立派な第一歩だと思うぞ。", "zh": "嗯，你们说得对！\n这的确也是了不起的第一步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "7df67ad18178eda9c7718547aeef06f99da9bb476a4d39f3abc056276066c450", "ja": "{$P$}！\nお弁当の後は、将棋とサッカーするヨ！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n吃完便当以后，要下将棋跟踢足球喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8ef91cf056e29424b73a633afd7a63559435f36b3571a2e3cf724e78cfe0c687", "ja": "将棋とサッカー……。ピクニックなのに、\nやけに荷物が多いと思ったら、そういう事か。", "zh": "将棋跟足球……我才在想明明是野餐，\n你们怎么大包小包的，原来是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "653e5033146a19bdbbf9b3772499444bcf14c63f9028795c83410410d4eadc90", "ja": "{$P$}は、将棋できる？\nできないなら、ワタシが教えてあげるネ！", "zh": "{$P$}会下将棋吗？\n不会的话，让我来教你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "4a8346adc4f77f17070261b292ed4e10eaaa3c8cc926f547e76138e3395c571d", "ja": "へえ、美也じゃなくてエレナがか？", "zh": "哦～是艾琳娜要教我，不是美也啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "f1d39a8b05084b8d5ad3db7ca72a4d7c168fb5bb1512cf3d6650b94a4d16121d", "ja": "エヘヘ♪\n最近ちょっと強くなってきたんだヨー。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n我最近有变强喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "b5b6e850d304a044412f46d980832eb16b146ad539b89a3e70d06269c603e95e", "ja": "そうなんですよ～。最近は、将棋センターの\nおじいちゃん達とも、いい勝負なんです～。", "zh": "就是啊～她最近都可以跟将棋中心的\n老爷爷们下得势均力敌了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7c25c166b73368f166e44524fa238270e67abaefb7f5b242f75ebf1005a36750", "ja": "へえ、それは手強そうだな。……けど、ふたりとも、\n打ち上げがピクニックで本当によかったのか？", "zh": "哦～感觉挺棘手的……不过你们俩，\n庆功宴真的只要野餐就好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "0140f6923467ee17765c33aae84569dde7388d2ebf7e1a9fbf87feaa24b9584b", "ja": "ウン！　ワタシたちはCleaskyだもん。\nせっかくなら、青空の下で楽しまなくちゃネ♪", "zh": "嗯！我们可是『Cleasky』。\n机会难得，当然要在蓝天下享受啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "ed8b4a24133aa263782c4dd950c71d9658389afd43f61ff393617f1642da11ee", "ja": "それに、ここだったら、\n広さを気にする必要がありませんからね～。", "zh": "而且，如果是这里，\n也不用担心空间不够大～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "9fab425896140449090bbfbe060b4ebcc56938e3c999f1150f3c08913a584f73", "ja": "広さ？", "zh": "空间？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "8d0b77a9e39af859471313ec925658171fad5c853eac1dc99cbf5c8167c36d1b", "ja": "はい～。私達だけでは寂しいので、\n将棋とサッカーには、ゲストをお呼びしたんですよ～。", "zh": "是的～只有我们玩会显得冷清，\n所以我们找了来宾一起来下将棋跟踢足球喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "91f69fab8902cf732b3d87548e0432d813257047fb4a706e4a073cd40905439c", "ja": "シャチョーに、コトリに、ミサキでしょ。\nアズサにレイカに……。", "zh": "有社长、小鸟、美咲，\n还有梓跟丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "190f89e94de4402b3e64d4bfc7325b584ef232fb817d8adad9727e31845492af", "ja": "将棋センターのおじいちゃん達、公園で会った\n小さい子達にも、声を掛けておきましたよ～。", "zh": "我们还叫了将棋中心的老爷爷，\n跟在公园认识的小孩子喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1049_p", "source_sha256": "070e8f24581179e204c9939abb258ff3f9a3f05f813fd6e4e732abfaea7b1f0d", "ja": "お、大人数だな……！　いくらなんでも\nスペースが足りないんじゃ……。", "zh": "哦，声势浩大呢……！\n这里的空间也会不够用吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1050_042miy", "source_sha256": "e8a82b1507beb307432b010177628bb1c9d7cd5e06d562581d4011ea5582fc7a", "ja": "きっと大丈夫ですよ～。\n可能性は、無限大ですからね～。ふふふ。", "zh": "一定没问题的～\n因为可能性，可是无限大啊～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1051_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf568f2bf0e704d6bd30b5b0e8b94e2e23cc22d113829541b7a132bbfa740d5a", "ja": "せっかくだから、ゲリラライブもしちゃおうかナ？", "zh": "要不要趁这个机会，办个街头演唱会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1052_042miy", "source_sha256": "531dd97e18c707552259c52b521e656b7e230056701743fa093fcdc458abc5af", "ja": "お～、いいですな～。私達の曲を、\nみなさんにも聞いてもらいましょう～♪", "zh": "哦～这点子不错～\n让大家也听听我们的歌吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1053_p", "source_sha256": "31a6e3aeb2277f5fb47254e754e8499ccf29bd91f58b5da3332da9b50d356c6a", "ja": "（美也とエレナ……Cleaskyから始まった絆が、\n思いもよらない形でどんどん広がっている）", "zh": "（美也和艾琳娜……从『Cleasky』开始的友谊，\n正以我预想不到的方式逐渐扩大。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_07_1054_p", "source_sha256": "b65d2ecc9a651a6a75050c1844d7d828ee8ca9fc0701989bbe9dc8449f13081d", "ja": "（可能性は無限大、だな！）", "zh": "（可能性无限大，一点也没错！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
